  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8cf72940f56fa4944b96a056293a7297, type: 3}
  m_Name: Bunny 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  npcTalking: Bunny
  _lines:
  - my mother sent me here because i 'hurt" her.
  - 'really, i just told her i didnt love her. '
  - i thought honesty was a good trait.
  - if anything, her affection digusts me.
  - she coos at me like i am a doll and wrinkles her nose at my raw expressions of
    self.
  - 'she throws a tantrum, entreating me to be "kind" and apologize for my actions. '
  - im repulsed by the womb i come from.
